# Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true, the common default)
# rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout for any file it guesses is text. keyring.db
# is a raw SQLite file and data/root.salt is raw binary — CRLF conversion
# corrupts them, breaking every seeded demo account and the KEK vault.
keyring.db binary
*.db binary
data/kek_store.enc.json binary
data/root.passphrase binary
data/root.salt binary
*.png binary
